WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Chewing is one of the best ways to train your jaw, but if you do it wrong,

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.600
you'll build your cheek muscles instead and end up looking bloated.

3
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.360
And before you start any hard or long chewing, get your jaw joints checked.

4
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.600
Always chew with your mouth closed. Modern diets are full of soft,

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.600
processed food that we eat fast, so our jaws barely get any work.

6
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.760
You could change your diet to chew more, but that's exactly why, if your jaw joints are healthy,

7
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:33.360
I recommend chewing hard gum 10 to 15 minutes a day, every day for 30 days.

8
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.960
The harder the gum, the more resistance your jaw gets.

9
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:44.400
And if your jaw feels sore after a few days, take a break and keep checking your jaw joints.
